node_modules/
dist/
# Only the worktrees, not the whole folder. `.claude/` wholesale meant this repo
# could not carry a `.claude/settings.json`, and without one a background session
# here is forced into `.claude/worktrees/` and its work never reaches main - the
# doctor's `bg isolation` check, 2026-09-19. The worktrees genuinely are a second
# checkout and stay ignored; the settings file is configuration and is not.
.claude/worktrees/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# The Android wrapper's output. `scripts/twa.ps1` builds an .aab/.apk in here,
# and a session that runs `git add -A` while another one is mid-build commits a
# megabyte of binary that nothing reads back. That happened on 2026-09-13: the
# T4 commit carried build/lattice.aab into the pushed history.
build/
